---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Scam-Proof Money">
  <h1>Got a suspicious message, call or email?</h1>
  <p class="lead">Short, plain-language guides to the scams that target ordinary people, and the one right move for each.</p>

  <div class="cards">
    <a class="list-link" href="/scams/">
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Is this a scam? Look it up in the Scam Library</h3>
        <p>How each scam works, the red flags, and what to do instead.</p>
      </div>
    </a>
    <a class="list-link" href="/been-scammed/">
      <div class="card">
        <h3>I've already been scammed. What now?</h3>
        <p>Step-by-step help by country: who to call and who to report to.</p>
      </div>
    </a>
    <div class="card soon">
      <h3>Protect my parents and kids</h3>
      <p>The Family Protection Kit. Coming soon.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
